index.description_en:
The index configuration data structure.

Scenario 1 (full-text index only):
```
{
    "line": {
        "chn": false,
        "caseSensitive": false,
        "token":[","," ","'","\"",";","=","(",")","[","]","{","}","?","@","<","&","/",":","\n","\t","\r"]
    }
}
```

Scenario 2 (full-text index and field index):
```
{
  "keys": {
    "region": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "text",
      "caseSensitive": false,
      "chn": false,
      "token": [","," ","'","\"",";","=","(",")","[","]","{","}","?","@","<","&","/",":","\n","\t","\r"]
    },
    "end_time": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "long"
    },
    "request_time": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "double"
    }
  },
  "line": {
    "caseSensitive": false,
    "chn": true
  }
}
```

