keys.description_en:
The field index configuration. The key is the field name, and the value is the field index configuration. At least one of the following must exist: full-text index, field index, or scan index.
Field index example:
```
{
    "region": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "text",
      "caseSensitive": false,
      "chn": false,
      "token": [","," ","'","\"",";","=","(",")","[","]","{","}","?","@","<","&","/",":","\n","\t","\r"]
    },
    "end_time": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "long"
    },
    "request_time": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "double"
    }
  }
```

